  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A phosphorus nuclide is represented by the symbol <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"{^{31}_{15}\\text{P}}\"></span>. Which row in the table gives the correct number of protons, neutrons and nucleons for this nuclide?</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th></th><th>Proton number</th><th>Neutron number</th><th>Nucleon number</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-label=\"A\"><td>A</td><td>15</td><td>31</td><td>15</td></tr><tr data-label=\"B\"><td>B</td><td>16</td><td>15</td><td>31</td></tr><tr data-label=\"C\"><td>C</td><td>31</td><td>15</td><td>46</td></tr><tr data-label=\"D\"><td>D</td><td>15</td><td>16</td><td>31</td></tr></tbody></table>"
